  "title": "Sweet and Spicy Air Fryer Butternut Squash Fries",
  "description": "Make butternut squash fries in the air fryer with garlic, black pepper, and five-spice powder for a sweet-spicy side dish with fewer carbs than regular fries.",
  "authors": [
    "Angela Sackett Superhotmama"
